 del polvo con anteojos y barbijo. 7- No enciendas fuego.","polygons":[[[-31.02,-68.5],[-31.02,-68.48],[-31.06,-68.5],[-31.1,-68.52],[-31.16,-68.54],[-31.26,-68.54],[-31.32,-68.56],[-31.38,-68.6],[-31.44,-68.6],[-31.54,-68.66],[-31.62,-68.66],[-31.72,-68.62],[-31.96,-68.66],[-32.06,-68.72],[-32.1,-68.78],[-32.18,-68.84],[-32.34,-68.86],[-32.34,-68.92],[-32.12,-68.92],[-32.1,-68.96],[-32.12,-69.02],[-32.1,-69.04],[-32.08,-69.08],[-32.04,-69.1],[-32.02,-69.12],[-32,-69.12],[-32,-69.2],[-32.02,-69.24],[-32.04,-69.26],[-32.08,-69.28],[-32.06,-69.3],[-32.08,-69.32],[-32.08,-69.34],[-32.06,-69.38],[-32.08,-69.46],[-32.08,-69.48],[-32,-69.56],[-32.06,-69.7],[-32.14,-69.86],[-31.94,-69.88],[-31.72,-69.74],[-31.58,-69.72],[-31.46,-69.78],[-31.26,-69.7],[-30.9,-69.68],[-30.82,-69.72],[-30.8,-69.58],[-30.68,-69.54],[-30.7,-69.4],[-30.74,-69.36],[-30.76,-69.3],[-30.76,-69.18],[-30.78,-69.1],[-30.74,-69.1],[-30.66,-69.12],[-30.64,-69.12],[-30.64,-69.06],[-30.54,-69.08],[-30.54,-68.92],[-30.56,-68.88],[-30.62,-68.88],[-30.68,-68.82],[-30.76,-68.82],[-30.8,-68.8],[-30.86,-68.76],[-31.02,-68.74],[-31.02,-68.5]]],"points":[]},{"id":"https://ssl.smn.gob.ar/feeds/CAP/xml_generados/CAP_20261018202915_Tormenta_Llanura_alertas_alertas_13.xml","event":"Tormentas","severity":"Moderate","certainty":"Likely","urgency":"Future","onset":"2026-10-20T15:00:00-03:00","expires":"2026-10-21T08:59:59-03:00","sent":"2026-10-18T20:29:09-03:00","msgType":"Update","description":"El área será afectada por chaparrones y tormentas de variada intensidad, de las cuales algunas pueden ser puntualmente fuertes. Las mismas podrán estar acompañadas principalmente por abundantes precipitaciones en cortos periodos; y además, ocasional caída de granizo chico y actividad eléctrica. Se esperan valores de precipitación acumulada entre 20 y 40 mm, que pueden ser superados de manera puntual.","instruction":"1- Evitá salir. 2- No saques la basura y limpiá desagües y sumideros. 3- Desconectá los electrodomésticos y cortá 